                <h2 class="fmstr-cmp-gdr-uc__h2" id="fmstr-cmp-gdr-uc-h2">What teams build with this connection</h2>
                <p class="fmstr-cmp-gdr-uc__sub">
                  Six common shapes the native integration covers without custom work.
                </p>
              </header>

              <div class="fmstr-cmp-gdr-uc__grid">
                <article class="fmstr-cmp-gdr-uc__card">
                  <span class="fmstr-cmp-gdr-uc__icon" aria-hidden="true">
