                  <h3 class="fmstr-cmp-gdr-uc__h3">Sales and Legal: Signed contracts</h3>
                  <p class="fmstr-cmp-gdr-uc__body">
                    Contract form with <a href="https://formester.com/features/electronic-signature/">e-signature</a> →
                    Drive folder for the contract type → signed PDF lands in the form's folder per submission. Audit
                    trail builds itself.
                  </p>
                </article>

                <article class="fmstr-cmp-gdr-uc__card">
                  <span class="fmstr-cmp-gdr-uc__icon" aria-hidden="true">
