                      <path d="M12 14v4M10 16h4"></path>
                    </svg>
                  </span>
                  <h3 class="fmstr-cmp-gdr-uc__h3">Healthcare and wellness: Patient intake</h3>
                  <p class="fmstr-cmp-gdr-uc__body">
                    Intake form with insurance card + ID upload → Drive folder for the practice → each patient's uploads
                    land in their own submission slot.
                  </p>
