                  <h3 class="fmstr-cmp-gdr-uc__h3">Education: Student submissions</h3>
                  <p class="fmstr-cmp-gdr-uc__body">
                    Assignment form per class → Drive folder per assignment → student uploads land in the assignment's
                    folder, one slot per submission. Teacher grades from a single sorted folder.
                  </p>
                </article>

