                  <h3 class="fmstr-cmp-gdr-uc__h3">Photography and creative: Client briefs + assets</h3>
                  <p class="fmstr-cmp-gdr-uc__body">
                    Brief form with brand-asset uploads → Drive folder per project → assets land alongside the brief
                    PDF. Designer opens one folder and has the entire context.
