                  </span>
                  <div>
                    <h3 class="fmstr-cmp-gdr-sec__h3">Encryption at rest</h3>
                    <p class="fmstr-cmp-gdr-sec__body">
                      Files are encrypted at rest in Google Drive per
                      <a href="https://cloud.google.com/docs/security/encryption/default-encryption"
                        >Google's encryption documentation</a
                      >. Formester's own storage uses AES-256.
                    </p>
                  </div>
                </li>
              </ul>
